entages are of revenue; figures may not sum due to rounding."],"report":{"summary":["Metropolitan Bank is the holding company for Metropolitan Commercial Bank, which provides banking services to individuals and businesses. Revenue (net interest income plus noninterest income) rose 13.8% to $315M in 2025. Net interest income rose 19.8% to $303M and noninterest income fell 50.2% to $11.9M; noninterest expense rose 1.4%, and the provision for credit losses was $37.6M, versus $6.3M.","Net income rose 6.6% to $71.1M, or $6.62 per diluted share, and the efficiency ratio was 55.9% versus 62.7%. Metropolitan Bank returned $80.1M through dividends and buybacks."],"highlights":["Revenue rose 13.8% to $315M.","Net interest income rose 19.8%.","Net income rose 6.6% to $71.1M.","Efficiency ratio improved to 55.9%."],"watch":["Noninterest income fell 50.2% to $11.9M.","Credit-loss provision rose 6.0× to $37.6M.","Net interest income depends on interest rates.","Noninterest expense was $176M, up 1.4%."],"table":[["Total revenue",0.3151,0.2769,1],["Net interest income",0.3032,0.2531],["Noninterest income",0.0119,0.0238],["Noninterest expense",0.176,0.1736],["Provision for credit losses",0.0376,0.0063],["Pre-tax income",0.1015,0.0971,1],["Income tax",0.0304,0.0304],["Net income",0.0711,0.0667,1],["Diluted EPS ($)",6.619999,5.929999,0,"eps"],["Book value per share ($)",73.65846,65.176946,0,"eps"]],"sources":[["Metropolitan Bank Holding Corp. Form 10-K filings (SEC EDGAR)","https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001476034&type=10-K"],["Metropolitan Bank financial statements (StockAnalysis)","https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/mcb/financials/"]]},"video":{"revenueLine":{"cap":"Net interest income was 96% of revenue.","say":"Net interest income made up 96 percent of revenue."},"spotlights":[{"kicker":"Revenue","big":"$315M","sub":"revenue · +13.8%","lines":["Net interest income $303M","Noninterest income $11.9M"],"cap":"Revenue rose 13.8% to $315M.","say":"Revenue